- (1) The adoption of an amendment to the Comprehensive Zoning Ordinance which changes the text of the zoning chapter;

- (2) The adoption of an amendment to the Comprehensive Zoning Ordinance which rezones property from one (1) zoning classification to another;

- (3) The adoption of an amendment to the zoning plan and map sponsored by the Town;

- (4) The adoption of an amendment to the zoning plan and map sponsored by the planning and zoning commission;

- (5) The adoption of an amendment to the zoning plan and map sponsored by a citizen/property owner.

- (ord. of 3-26-1996)

